    "notes": "FY2025 vs FY2022 revenue 6,150.5 -> 7,401.1. Revenue 5yr CAGR null: FY2018-FY2021 annual revenue is missing from the XBRL-derived CSV. Owner-FCF series (reported FCF - SBC): FY2020 1,165, FY2022 963, FY2025 1,624. The 3yr owner-FCF CAGR (19%) starts from a working-capital-depressed FY2022 and overstates the trend; the 5yr (6.9%) is closer to the underlying rate. SBC grew roughly with revenue, so SBC-adjusted and reported FCF CAGRs are near identical."
