    "wacc_rationale": "USD flows. Risk-free 4.3% (10y UST), ERP 5.0%, beta ~1.05 -> cost of equity ~9.5%; post-Indicor debt ~11% of capital at ~4.0% after tax -> WACC ~8.9%, rounded to 8.5% for a diversified, low-cyclicality niche-instrument compounder with 20-year margin record. One WACC across scenarios; risk is carried in the bear flows, not a rate premium.",
